### PriPriTrip API
### Base URL: http://localhost:8000
### Requires the REST Client extension (humao.rest-client)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Authentication
# Run this request first, copy the token from the response, and paste it
# into the @token variable below.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

### POST /auth — obtain a bearer token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "password": "honeymoon"
}

# After running the request above, set the token here:
@token = <paste-token-here>

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Health
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

### GET /health — liveness check (no auth required)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Import (bulk load)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

